tc1">The company announced yesterday that search traffic was “down meaningfully,” with CEO Steve Huffman saying that Google’s AI-powered search modes <a href="/tech/1022848/reddit-ceo-google-ai-mode-traffic">don’t “drive traffic.”</a> Today’s stock market fall was its worst since going public in 2024, <a href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/30/reddit-stock-q3-earnings.html">CNBC reports</a>.</p></div><div class="_1y5ugvbf"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1044qizi _18mzr4b1 _18mzr4b0 _19wv7tc1">Yesterday, Reddit also announced that the platform will soon <a href="/tech/1022571/reddit-login-requirement-q3-2026-earnings">start requiring users to log in</a>.</p></div></div><div class="_1p001ee0"><div class="_1y5ugvbe"><div class="_1y5ugvb9"><a class="_1y5ugvba" href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/30/reddit-stock-q3-earnings.html" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Reddit stock plunges 29% after weak outlook, wrapping its worst day ever</a><p class="_1y5ugvbb">[<!-- -->CNBC<!-- -->]</p></div></div></div></div><div class="dq5wa40"><span class="dq5wa41"><span class="_4zezgs7"><a class="duet--article--comments-link _4zezgsc" href="/tech/1023928/reddits-stock-fell-29-percent-today-following-tough-earnings#comments"><svg class="_4zezgs13" width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Comments</title><desc>Comment Icon Bubble</desc><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.8999 2.10001C2.76729 2.10001 2.64012 2.15268 2.54635 2.24645C2.45258 2.34022 2.3999 2.4674 2.3999 2.60001V9.3929L3.6928 8.10001H9.8999C10.0325 8.10001 10.1597 8.04733 10.2535 7.95356C10.3472 7.85979 10.3999 7.73261 10.3999 7.60001V2.60001C10.3999 2.4674 10.3472 2.34022 10.2535 2.24645C10.1597 2.15268 10.0325 2.10001 9.8999 2.10001H2.8999ZM1.83924 1.53935C2.12055 1.25804 2.50208 1.10001 2.8999 1.10001H9.8999C10.2977 1.10001 10.6793 1.25804 10.9606 1.53935C11.2419 1.82065 11.3999 2.2