5 16.9691L27.4394 22.4798L27.4394 22.4796Z"></path></svg></button></div></span></div></div></div><div class="duet--content-cards--content-card duet--content-cards--quick-post rj2ep84 rj2ep89" role="article" id="latest-dmcyOnF1aWNrUG9zdDoxMDIzOTEz"><a aria-label="Are you seeing AI Overviews less often?" class="rj2ep88" href="/tech/1023913/are-you-seeing-ai-overviews-less-often"></a><div class="rj2ep81"><div class="rj2ep87"><div class="_1jiz7rn0 _1jiz7rn1"><div class="_1jiz7rn7"><img alt="Jay Peters" data-chromatic="ignore" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="_4aoxp34" style="color:transparent" srcset="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=48 1x, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96 2x" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/01/JAY_BLURPLE.jpg?quality=90&amp;strip=all&amp;crop=0%2C0%2C100%2C100&amp;w=96"></div><div class="_1jiz7rn2 _1jiz7rn3"><span class="_1jiz7rn6">Jay Peters</span><span class="duet--article--timestamp g4xafw2 g4xafw0 _19wv7tc5 _1jiz7rna"><time datetime="2026-10-30T21:56:07+00:00">Oct 31</time></span></div></div><div class="_4ine551 _4ine550"><div class="_4ine554">Are you seeing AI Overviews less often?</div><div class="_1y5ugvbf _1y5ugvb0"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1044qizi _18mzr4b1 _18mzr4b0 _19wv7tc1">We saw a post <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/sky.skymarchini.net/post/3mz4cb6fa522i">on Bluesky</a> today about how Google is apparently now turning off AI Overviews “by default,” with one reply <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/escapedexplorer.bsky.social/post/3mz4dflyxwk2o">speculating that</a> AI Overviews appeared if you phrased a query as a question.</p></div><div class="_1y5ugvbf"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1044qizi _18mzr4b1 _18mzr4b0 _19wv7tc1">But Google spokesperson Peter Schottenfels tells <em>The Verge</em> that “We haven’t reduced the triggering of AI Overviews, and we’ve always said that AI Overviews are dynamic and won’t show on every query.” Schottenfels also notes that keyword or navigational queries may not trigger AI responses.</p></div><div class="_1y5ugvbf"><p class="duet--article--dangerously-set-cms-markup duet--article--standard-paragraph _1044qizi _18mzr4b1 _18mzr4b0 _19wv7tc1">Are you noticing anything different?</p></div></div></div><div class="dq5wa40"><span class="dq5wa41"><span class="_4zezgs7"><a class="duet--article--comments-link _4zezgsc" href="/tech/1023913/are-you-seeing-ai-overviews-less-often#comments"><svg class="_4zezgs13" width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Comments</title><desc>Comment Icon Bubble</desc><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.8999 2.10001C2.76729 2.10001 2.64012 2.15268 2.54635 2.24645C2.45258 2.34022 2.3999 2.4674 2.3999 2.60001V9.3929L3.6928 8.10001H9.8999C10.0325 8.10001 10.1597 8.04733 10.2535 7.95356C10.3472 7.85979 10.3999 7.73261 10.3999 7.60001V2.60001C10.3999 2.4674 10.3472 2.34022 10.2535 2.24645C10.1597 2.15268 10.0325 2.10001 9.8999 2.10001H2.8999ZM1.83924 1.53935C2.12055 1.25804 2.50208 1.10001 2.8999 1.10001H9.8999C10.2977 1.10001 10.6793 1.25804 10.9606 1.53935C11.2419 1.82065 11.3999 2.20218 11.3999 2.60001V7.60001C11.3999 7.99783 11.2419 8.37936 10.9606 8.66067C10.6793 8.94197 10.2977 9.10001 9.8999 9.10001H4.10701L1.3999 11.8071V2.60001C1.3999 2.20218 1.55794 1.82065 1.83924 1.53935Z"></path></svg><span class="_4zezgs14"><span>9</span></span></a></span></span><span class="_1044qizr"></span><span class="dq5wa42"><div class="_1jiz7rnb dq5wa43"><button aria-label="Copy link"><svg class="_1jiz7rnd" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 40 40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org